You grab the cutoff and haul it down. It answers with a spit of blue sparks, and the fire doesn't care. Flame runs the ceiling seam above you, quick and orange. The smoke comes down in a wall, and you back away with your sleeve jammed against your face, eyes streaming.

<npc>"That did not help!"</npc> the voice shouts from farther aft, closer now.

